        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="840.0967" YPOS="87.32010393701" OwnPage="-1" ItemID="243680992" PTYPE="4" WIDTH="290.6215" HEIGHT="66.6046960629899" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="1" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="1" LOCALSCY="1" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="1" RATIO="1" COLUMNS="1" COLGAP="0" AUTOTEXT="0" EXTRA="0" TEXTRA="0" BEXTRA="0" REXTRA="0" VAlign="0" FLOP="1" PLTSHOW="0" BASEOF="0" textPathType="0" textPathFlipped="0" path="M0 0 L290.621 0 L290.621 66.6047 L0 66.6047 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L290.624 0 L290.624 66.6048 L0 66.6048 L0 0 Z" gXpos="840.0967" gYpos="87.32010393701" gWidth="282.55" gHeight="45.4146798798563" ALIGN="0" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1">
            <StoryText>
                <DefaultStyle ALIGN="0" LINESP="28" FONT="Special Elite Regular" FONTSIZE="33" SCALEH="88" KERN="-9"/>
                <ITEXT CH="Call Me in Case of Campus Emergencies"/>
                <trail ALIGN="1"/>
            </StoryText>
        </PAGEOBJECT>
        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="1022.66091052632" YPOS="806.208" OwnPage="-1" ItemID="244540944" PTYPE="4" WIDTH="288.905289473684" HEIGHT="177.8208" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="0" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="1" LOCALSCY="1" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="1" RATIO="1" COLUMNS="2" COLGAP="7.2" AUTOTEXT="0" EXTRA="0" TEXTRA="0" BEXTRA="0" REXTRA="0" VAlign="0" FLOP="1" PLTSHOW="0" BASEOF="0" textPathType="0" textPathFlipped="0" path="M0 0 L288.905 0 L288.905 177.821 L0 177.821 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L288.905 0 L288.905 177.821 L0 177.821 L0 0 Z" gXpos="1022.66091052632" gYpos="806.207999999987" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" PSTYLE="Default Paragraph Style" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1">
            <StoryText>
                <DefaultStyle PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" LINESP="10" FONT="Bell MT Regular" FONTSIZE="9" KERN="0" LANGUAGE="en_US"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Bold" FONTSIZE="9" CH="Cade Suko"/>
                <para PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Italic" FONTSIZE="9" KERN="0" CH="Really Cool Guy BTW "/>
                <para PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Imagine this: you’ve been shot and you’re bleeding out on the ground. You call the campus police to come save you, but they send out a guy with another gun! Do you feel safe in this situation? Do you trust this random stranger not to also shoot you? Of course not! But I have a better idea: just call me instead. "/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Is there a criminal on the loose? I’m literally 6 foot 3. That criminal is getting hit with the good ol’ Cade Combo. All my homies can attest to my power."/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Are you having a medical emergency? Do you trust a random CMU-sponsored stranger to give you mouth-to-mouth, or do you trust me? I’ve kissed a lot of people before, and hardly any of them died!"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Is a building on fire? That’s pretty awesome—please call me so I can get there before the fire department does. I’ve always wanted to heroically run into a burning building."/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    I’m your friend, and I can be trusted with this stuff more than the CMUPD can. If I’m not your friend, what are you waiting for?? Just call!"/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
            </StoryText>
        </PAGEOBJECT>
        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="-436.6136" YPOS="1061.88935384615" OwnPage="-1" ItemID="244546608" PTYPE="4" WIDTH="305.2943" HEIGHT="36.0066461538497" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="1" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="1" LOCALSCY="1" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="1" RATIO="1" COLUMNS="1" COLGAP="0" AUTOTEXT="0" EXTRA="0" TEXTRA="0" BEXTRA="0" REXTRA="0" VAlign="0" FLOP="1" PLTSHOW="0" BASEOF="0" textPathType="0" textPathFlipped="0" path="M0 0 L305.294 0 L305.294 36.0066 L0 36.0066 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L305.295 0 L305.295 36.0064 L0 36.0064 L0 0 Z" gXpos="-436.6136" gYpos="1061.88615384615" gWidth="282.55" gHeight="45.4146798798563" ALIGN="1" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1">
            <StoryText>
                <DefaultStyle ALIGN="1" LINESP="28" FONT="Special Elite Regular" FONTSIZE="33" SCALEH="90" KERN="-10"/>
                <ITEXT SCALEH="90" KERN="-10" CH="THE FUNNIEST JOKE EVER"/>
                <trail/>
            </StoryText>
        </PAGEOBJECT>
        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="-307.339089473684" YPOS="1513.848" OwnPage="-1" ItemID="244549440" PTYPE="4" WIDTH="320.339889473684" HEIGHT="181.741300397187" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="0" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="1" LOCALSCY="1" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="1" RATIO="1" COLUMNS="2" COLGAP="7.2" AUTOTEXT="0" EXTRA="0" TEXTRA="0" BEXTRA="0" REXTRA="0" VAlign="0" FLOP="1" PLTSHOW="0" BASEOF="0" textPathType="0" textPathFlipped="0" path="M0 0 L320.34 0 L320.34 181.741 L0 181.741 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L320.34 0 L320.34 181.741 L0 181.741 L0 0 Z" gXpos="-307.339089473684" gYpos="1513.84799999999" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" PSTYLE="Default Paragraph Style" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1">
            <StoryText>
                <DefaultStyle PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" LINESP="10" FONT="Bell MT Regular" FONTSIZE="9" KERN="0" LANGUAGE="en_US"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Bold" FONTSIZE="9" CH="Alex Soda"/>
                <para PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Italic" FONTSIZE="9" KERN="0" CH="Conflict of interest free!"/>
                <para PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Rabbits have officially claimed squatters’ rights on the CMU Mall and CFA Lawn following years of occupation. The invasive creatures were first introduced fifty years ago when a freshman living in Mudge brought their hobby rabbit farm to campus. The university initially tried to contain them, but efforts ceased after a particularly short member of Furries@CMU was mistakenly shot."/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Meanwhile, the rabbits continue to stake their claim on the land. They said (through a monkey that knows sign language), “PA Code § 5530 is clear that the rabbits have the right to live on CMU campus for eternity.&quot; CMU strongly disagrees: “We are closely consulting with our university lawyer to get these vermin off our holy land,” said a CMU spokesperson. “He’s very busy though, so it might be a bit.” "/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Using their newfound rights, the rabbits have already enlisted the help of the deer (also seeking squatters’ rights) to replant the Mall trees and construct a large model of a killer rabbit in front of the CFA. “You’re never putting up another tent on the CFA Lawn,” the rabbits taunted. CMU is currently working on a proposal to move the killer robot somewhere which satisfies all members of the community."/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
            </StoryText>
        </PAGEOBJECT>
        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="725.3527" YPOS="830.247707476833" OwnPage="-1" ItemID="247767440" PTYPE="2" WIDTH="265.530902654867" HEIGHT="337.061946902655" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="0" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="0.204279967819791" LOCALSCY="0.204279967819791" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="0" RATIO="1" Pagenumber="0" PFILE="KGB Ad.png" IRENDER="0" EMBEDDED="0" path="M0 0 L265.531 0 L265.531 337.062 L0 337.062 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L265.531 0 L265.531 337.062 L0 337.062 L0 0 Z" ImageRes="0" gXpos="725.3527" gYpos="1662.25090747683" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1"/>
